      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, thanks. the disclaimer about the classifier is noted. \n\ncan you dig a bit deeper into the \"suspicious pings\"? i need more substance for the briefing. give me a more detailed breakdown of the specific subnets being targeted and the likely next steps for Vanguard. try to be as specific as possible about the threat level they pose to the actual grid stability.",
